					"content": "欸，是「凶」！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721130403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721130403,
					"content": "这种情况我记得！是说…「把凶签捆到『御签挂』上。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721130404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721130404,
					"content": "「然后请派蒙吃好吃的，就可以逢凶化吉。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721130405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721130405,
					"content": "是这样喔？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721130406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721130406,
					"content": "当然了！你要质疑古人的智慧吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721130407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721130407,
					"content": "古人的智慧真了不起哪！总之，先找找御签挂吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
